@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digidoclocker

state Unidentified
state Registration
state LoggedIn
state DocumentUpload
state ProfileView
state CertificateApplication
state CertificateVerification

[*] --> Unidentified : System Start

Unidentified --> Registration : User Access System
Registration --> LoggedIn : Valid Registration Details
Registration --> Unidentified : Invalid Registration Details

LoggedIn --> DocumentUpload : Upload Documents
LoggedIn --> ProfileView : View Profile
LoggedIn --> CertificateApplication : Apply for Certificate
LoggedIn --> CertificateVerification : Request Certificate Verification

DocumentUpload --> DocumentUpload : Continue Uploading
DocumentUpload --> LoggedIn : Upload Complete

CertificateApplication --> CertificateApplication : Reapply
CertificateApplication --> LoggedIn : Application Sent

CertificateVerification --> LoggedIn : Verification Complete

LoggedIn --> [*] : User Logout

@enduml
